/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With India moving towards to be a 5 Trillion dollar nation, the growth in corporate sector is expected to be phenomenal. This growth can only be achieved with skilled management professionals who are trained to handle different industries and service organizations. GBU-School of Management has been nurturing students from different academic streams through their graduate and post graduate programmes to become business leaders. The School of Management established in 2009 has been imparting quality education pivoted on a rigorous curriculum and strong industry-academia relation. The output of these efforts are well reflected through the placements which have been above 75% in the last three years, with highest salary package of 12 lakh p.a. and average package of 5 lakh p.a.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The School of Management has carved out a sizeable niche amongst MBA aspirants with students coming not only from India, but also other foreign countries. A strong global alumni network also fosters this commitment towards skill oriented education by providing mentorships, internships and job opportunities for current batches of students. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
