368 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (One of the greatest challenges of management education worldwide today is to make managers who are not only to ready to lead, plan, organize their people and resources in a highly competitive and turbulent corporate environment, but are also ethically driven.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
369 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Gautam Buddha University being an important center for Buddhist learning is trying to provide a solution to this problem.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
370 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our MBA programme is amongst the only Management Course in the country where we have amalgamated contemporary business concepts, tools and techniques with Buddhist Philosophy and ethics, so as not just to make competitive managers, but modern age business leaders who are not just driven by narrow soulless competition but are philosophical, kind and virtuous to their job and the people around them.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
371 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Students have compulsorily to take up course in Buddhist Philosophy each year. Along with this continuous meditation classes and Bipasana training form a component of their Programme training.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
